    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69654" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ναϊ-άς</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηϊάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Naiad,
				river-nymph, spring-nymph</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				13.104
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				356
			</span></i> (pl.): in sg., <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.626
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ναΐς</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Νηΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ΐδος, ἡ</span>, in
			sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νηΐς Ἀβαρβαρέη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη τέκε νηΐς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.444
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				187
			</span></i> (lyr.): pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ναΐδες</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				8.4.2
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
